# Workstation: Jay's machine (packages-20261031). niri with DankMaterialShell
# as the everyday session, a trimmed Plasma alongside it, Plasma Login Manager,
# and a heavy dev/virtualisation toolchain. Packages already in base aren't
# repeated. Use on its own with base (plus nvidia on NVIDIA machines); don't
# combine with desktop or kde, which bring SDDM.

# ── Boot, kernel, disks (a vanilla Arch install usually has these already) ──
linux
linux-headers
linux-firmware
intel-ucode
sof-firmware
grub
efibootmgr
btrfs-progs
grub-btrfs            # boot into snapper snapshots from the GRUB menu
snapper
btrfs-assistant
zram-generator        # compressed swap in RAM; set up in kconfig
arch-install-scripts
wpa_supplicant

# ── niri session ──
niri
